        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rick Seibold, Lee DeWyze, David Archuleta, Katelyn Tarver, Kat DeLuna, Alex Lambert, Drew Pearson, Julian Emery, Justin Irvin, Shelly Fairchild, Matthew Wilder, Toby Gad\n- Albums/Songs: Frames, Sweet Serendipity, Live It Up\n- TV Series: Big Time Rush, No Ordinary Family, The Secret Life of the American Teenager\n- Organizations: Nickelodeon, ABC, ABC Family, American Idol\n\nFacts:\n- Rick Seibold has worked with artists including Lee DeWyze, David Archuleta, Katelyn Tarver, Kat DeLuna, and Alex Lambert.\n- Katelyn Tarver is known for recurring roles as Jo Taylor on Nickelodeon's \"Big Time Rush,\" Natalie on ABC's \"No Ordinary Family,\" and Mercedes on ABC Family's \"The Secret Life of the American Teenager.\"\n- \"Sweet Serendipity\" is Lee DeWyze's first single from his post-\"American Idol\" debut album \"Live It Up.\"\n- On the album \"Frames,\" Lee DeWyze has six solo writing credits and co-wrote all other songs with Drew Pearson, Julian Emery, Justin Irvin, Shelly Fairchild, Rick Seibold, Matthew Wilder, and Toby Gad.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
